    "analysisId": "a-channels",
    "textHash": "6a1bab0b",
    "answer": "最初の集客にはHacker Newsを使った（本人の話）。"
  },
  {
    "entityId": "ent_codementor_ba692caa3db3",
    "analysisId": "a-business_model",
    "textHash": "135b4bb4",
    "answer": "-",
    "hidden": true
  },
  {
